{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:56 2026-11-13 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:56 2026-11-13 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:56 2026-11-13 HKT</p><p>屯門市廣場對開屯門公路，今日（11月13日）下午3時許一部貨車起火，車頭及貨斗被烈焰吞噬，濃濃黑煙充斥隔音屏內，伸手不見五指。起火後司機急忙逃生，大批途經市民急忙報案。消防接報後趕至撲救，起火原因有待調查。</p><img alt=\"貨車被烈焰吞噬。FB：馬路的事討論區\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e51c643ed0c71f2e216826781aac0d41/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-13_at_15_47_05.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"貨車被烈焰吞噬。網上圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1f0a504949b087f7e222a4d3ddba6781/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-13_at_15_50_31_0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"貨車被烈焰吞噬。網上圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6d4f31b7730b2e441f0cfb8ff35fbd13/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-13_at_15_54_41.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"濃濃黑煙充斥隔音屏內，伸手不見五指。FB：屯門公路塞車關注組\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/19ff4c664e38b787dc609edda4069f23/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-13_at_15_57_52.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"濃濃黑煙充斥隔音屏內，伸手不見五指。FB：屯門公路塞車關注組\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b910a9e67f13bdbe2592a835734c0943/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-13_at_15_57_51.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T08:18:31.276730+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T07:56:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T08:11:52.200375+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T08:11:52.200375+00:00","content_hash":"455b4a779a71d7a924214d0d61b3092e012e0bdf3d587da2f2abd110eb8866c3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}